<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#8e0038" />
    <meta name="description" content="Site de Reza do Terço, Rosário, Quaresma de São Miguel, Palavras de Cristo e Orações Católicas para edificação espiritual e disciplina cristã." />
    <title>✞ Reza do terço, rosário e oração ✞</title>

    <!-- Tipografia Sagrada e Moderna -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@500;700;800&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #d63384;
            --primary-dark: #8e0038;
            --primary-light: #ff99c8;
            --accent-gold: #e5b95f;
            --text-gold: #fff1c7;
            --surface-modal: #fff5f8;
            --text-dark: #3b0928;
            --text-muted: #5e1d44;
            --glass-bg: rgba(22, 5, 16, 0.65);
            --glass-border: rgba(255, 214, 224, 0.22);
            --radius-btn: 30px;
            --radius-card: 22px;
            --shadow-sacred: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
        }

        *, *::before, *::after {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(18, 4, 13, 0.72), rgba(18, 4, 13, 0.85)),
            url('https://images.pexels.com/photos/9798458/pexels-photo-9798458.jpeg') no-repeat center center fixed;
            background-size: cover;
            color: #fff;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body.modal-open {
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* --- Cabeçalho Nobre --- */
        header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 3rem 1.5rem 2.5rem;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.78) 0%, rgba(20, 3, 15, 0.45) 100%);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sacred);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            position: relative;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
            font-family: 'Cinzel', 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffe5ec;
            text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 153, 200, 0.6), 2px 2px 4px #000;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
        }

        header p {
            font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.25rem);
            color: #ffd6e0;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 300;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        /* --- Player de Rádio Integrado --- */
        #radio-player-container {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.85rem;
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            padding: 0.55rem 1.4rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }

        #radio-player-container:hover {
            border-color: var(--primary-light);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(214, 51, 132, 0.4);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        #radio-player-button {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--primary-dark) 100%);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
            border-radius: 50%;
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 153, 200, 0.5);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: white;
            outline: none;
        }

        #radio-player-button:hover {
            transform: scale(1.08);
            box-shadow: 0 0 22px rgba(255, 153, 200, 0.85);
        }

        #radio-player-button.playing {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2e7d32 0%, #1b5e20 100%);
            box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.7);
        }

        #radio-player-button.loading {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f57f17 0%, #e65100 100%);
            animation: pulse-spin 1.2s infinite ease-in-out;
        }

        @keyframes pulse-spin {
            0% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.9; }
            50% { transform: scale(1.08); opacity: 1; }
            100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.9; }
        }

        #radio-status {
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }

        /* --- Conteúdo Principal e Seções --- */
        main {
            flex-grow: 1;
            padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 3.5rem;
            max-width: 1280px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .section-header-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin: 2.2rem 0 1.2rem;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .section-header-title::before,
        .section-header-title::after {
            content: "";
            height: 1px;
            width: 50px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--accent-gold), transparent);
        }

        .container-cards {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        /* --- Botões Nobres --- */
        .botao-misterio, .botao-secao {
            padding: 1.1rem 1.8rem;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(214, 51, 132, 0.9) 0%, rgba(142, 0, 56, 0.95) 100%);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 214, 224, 0.35);
            border-radius: var(--radius-btn);
            color: white;
            font-size: 1.08rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35), 0 0 12px rgba(255, 153, 200, 0.25);
            transition: all 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            cursor: pointer;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
            text-align: center;
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .botao-misterio::after, .botao-secao::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: -100%;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25), transparent);
            transition: left 0.6s ease;
        }

        .botao-misterio:hover::after, .botao-secao:hover::after {
            left: 100%;
        }

        .botao-misterio:hover, .botao-secao:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #e6398f 0%, #a60042 100%);
            transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 24px rgba(255, 153, 200, 0.6);
            border-color: #fff;
        }

        .btn-destaque-arcanjo {
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #b82260 0%, #540324 100%);
            border: 1.5px solid var(--accent-gold);
            color: var(--text-gold);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), 0 0 18px rgba(229, 185, 95, 0.3);
        }

        .btn-destaque-arcanjo:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #d82b74 0%, #700632 100%);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), 0 0 26px rgba(229, 185, 95, 0.7);
        }

        /* --- Modais Imersivos --- */
        .modal {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            z-index: 1000;
            left: 0;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background-color: rgba(10, 2, 8, 0.85);
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.35s ease, backdrop-filter 0.35s ease;
            pointer-events: none;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
        }

        .modal.active {
            display: flex;
            opacity: 1;
            pointer-events: auto;
        }

        .modal-content {
            background: linear-gradient(170deg, #fffafd 0%, #fdeff4 100%);
            color: var(--text-dark);
            margin: auto;
            padding: 2.8rem 2.4rem;
            border-radius: var(--radius-card);
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 800px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65), 0 0 0 1px rgba(214, 51, 132, 0.15);
            text-align: left;
            position: relative;
            transform: translateY(30px) scale(0.97);
            transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
            max-height: 88vh;
            overflow-y: auto;
            scrollbar-width: thin;
            scrollbar-color: var(--primary-light) transparent;
        }

        .modal-content::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 7px;
        }
        .modal-content::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: var(--primary-light);
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .modal.active .modal-content {
            transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
        }

        .close-button {
            color: var(--primary-dark);
            position: absolute;
            top: 18px;
            right: 22px;
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(214, 51, 132, 0.08);
        }

        .close-button:hover,
        .close-button:focus {
            color: #fff;
            background-color: var(--primary);
            transform: rotate(90deg);
        }

        .modal-content h2 {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.3rem);
            color: var(--primary-dark);
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(214, 51, 132, 0.15);
            padding-bottom: 0.8rem;
        }

        .modal-content img.terco-img {
            display: block;
            max-width: 170px;
            height: auto;
            margin: 0 auto 1.5rem auto;
            border-radius: 14px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            border: 2px solid #fff;
        }

        .modal-content .rezas-container {
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
            padding-top: 1.5rem;
            border-top: 1px dashed #e6a8bf;
        }

        .modal-content h3 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 1.45rem;
            color: #a61e4d;
            margin: 1.4rem 0 0.8rem;
        }

        .modal-content p,
        .modal-content ul,
        .modal-content ol {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            line-height: 1.75;
            color: #42112e;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .modal-content ul,
        .modal-content ol {
            padding-left: 1.5rem;
        }

        .modal-content li {
            margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
        }

        .modal-lead {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #70103e;
            background: rgba(214, 51, 132, 0.07);
            padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
            border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .quaresma-step {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #f3cbdb;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 1.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(142, 0, 56, 0.05);
        }

        .quaresma-step h4 {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            color: var(--primary-dark);
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .custom-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 1.2rem 0;
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(142,0,56,0.08);
        }

        .custom-table th, .custom-table td {
            padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
            text-align: left;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f3cbdb;
        }

        .custom-table th {
            background-color: #f7d6e4;
            color: var(--primary-dark);
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        /* --- Links de Versículos Bíblicos --- */
        .versiculo-link {
            color: #a61e4d;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-bottom: 1.5px dotted var(--primary);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            padding: 0 2px;
        }

        .versiculo-link:hover {
            color: #fff;
            background-color: var(--primary);
            border-radius: 4px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        /* --- Estilo para links dos documentos oficiais --- */
        .documento-link {
            color: #5e1d44;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary-dark);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            padding: 0 2px;
            background-color: rgba(214, 51, 132, 0.05);
            border-radius: 3px;
        }

        .documento-link:hover {
            color: #fff;
            background-color: var(--primary-dark);
            border-radius: 4px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        /* --- Rodapé --- */
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(20, 3, 15, 0.6) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) 100%);
            padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
            font-style: italic;
            margin-top: auto;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        }

        footer p.quote {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            color: #ffe5ec;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        footer .footer-links a {
            color: #ffd6e0;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        footer .footer-links a:hover {
            color: var(--primary-light);
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        footer .info-text {
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #e0d0d8;
            line-height: 1.5;
            max-width: 850px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        footer .info-text a {
            color: var(--primary-light);
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        footer .copyright {
            margin-top: 1.2rem;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #bfa8b3;
            font-style: normal;
        }

        .download-app {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 1.2rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-dark) 0%, #5a0023 100%);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 214, 224, 0.3);
            padding: 0.75rem 1.6rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-style: normal;
            text-decoration: none;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .download-app:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ad0044 0%, #7a0030 100%);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(214, 51, 132, 0.4);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            header { padding: 2rem 1rem 1.8rem; }
            .container-cards { gap: 0.9rem; }
            .botao-misterio, .botao-secao {
                width: 100%;
                font-size: 1.05rem;
                padding: 1rem 1.4rem;
            }
            .modal-content {
                padding: 2rem 1.4rem;
                max-height: 92vh;
            }
            .modal-content h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; }
            .modal-content h3 { font-size: 1.3rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>✞ Reza do terço, rosário e oração ✞</h1>
    <p>Consagrado à disciplina, fé e adoração do Cristão(ã) Católico(a)</p>

    <div id="radio-player-container">
        <audio id="catholicRadio" preload="none" crossorigin="anonymous"></audio>
        <button id="radio-player-button" aria-label="Tocar ou pausar Rádio Católica">▶</button>
        <span id="radio-status">Rádio Católica</span>
    </div>
</header>

<main>
    <!-- NOVA SEÇÃO: Orações Essenciais -->
    <div class="section-header-title">Orações Essenciais para Todo Católico</div>
    <div class="container-cards">
        <button class="botao-secao btn-destaque-arcanjo" data-modal-target="modalOracoesFotos">📿 Acesse as Orações das Imagens</button>
    </div>

    <div class="section-header-title">Santos Mistérios do Terço</div>
    <div class="container-cards">
        <button class="botao-misterio" data-modal-target="modalGozosos">Mistérios Gozosos</button>
        <button class="botao-misterio" data-modal-target="modalDolorosos">Mistérios Dolorosos</button>
        <button class="botao-misterio" data-modal-target="modalGloriosos">Mistérios Gloriosos</button>
        <button class="botao-misterio" data-modal-target="modalLuminosos">Mistérios Luminosos</button>
    </div>

    <div class="section-header-title">Devoções Principais & Quaresma Sagrada</div>
    <div class="container-cards">
        <button class="botao-secao btn-destaque-arcanjo" data-modal-target="modalQuaresmaSaoMiguel">⚔ Quaresma & Rosário de São Miguel ⚔</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalBonfim">Consagração ao Senhor do Bonfim</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalRosarioCompleto">Rezas do Rosário & Ladainha</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalPrincipaisOracoes">Principais Orações Católicas</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalConsagracaoDeus">Consagração a Deus</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalOracaoTodoPoderoso">Oração a Deus Todo Poderoso</button>
    </div>

    <div class="section-header-title">Variados Terços de Poder & Graça</div>
    <div class="container-cards">
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalMisericordia">Terço da Divina Misericórdia</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalSantasChagas">Terço das Santas Chagas</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalSangueCristo">Terço do Preciosíssimo Sangue</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalLagrimas">Terço das Lágrimas de Maria</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalSagradoCoracao">Terço do Sagrado Coração</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalSaoBento">Terço de São Bento</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalDesatadora">Terço Desatadora dos Nós</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalSaoJose">Terço de São José</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalSaoRafael">Terço de São Rafael Arcanjo</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalSaoGabriel">Terço de São Gabriel Arcanjo</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalSantaRita">Terço de Santa Rita de Cássia</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalSantoAntonio">Terço de Santo Antônio</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalNossaSenhoraCarmo">Terço de Nossa Senhora do Carmo</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalNossaSenhoraFatima">Terço de Nossa Senhora de Fátima</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalMeninoJesus">Terço do Menino Jesus de Praga</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalSaoJudas">Terço de São Judas Tadeu</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalSantaLuzia">Terço de Santa Luzia</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalEspiritoSanto">Terço do Espírito Santo</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalLibertacao">Terço da Libertação</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalAlmas">Terço pelas Almas do Purgatório</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalSantoExpedito">Terço de Santo Expedito</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalSantaTeresinha">Terço de Santa Teresinha</button>
    </div>

    <div class="section-header-title">Palavras Sagradas de Cristo Explicadas</div>
    <div class="container-cards">
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalCristoMontanha">As Bem-Aventuranças (Mt 5)</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalCristoAmor">O Mandamento Novo do Amor (Jo 13)</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalCristoVideira">A Videira Verdadeira (Jo 15)</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalCristoBomPastor">O Bom Pastor que Dá a Vida (Jo 10)</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalCristoPerdaoCruz">As Sete Palavras da Cruz</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalCristoEnvio">A Grande Comissão Missionária (Mt 28)</button>
    </div>

    <div class="section-header-title">Prática Cristã Cotidiana & Doutrina</div>
    <div class="container-cards">
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalOQueFazer">O Que o Católico DEVE Fazer</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalOQueNaoFazer">O Que o Católico NÃO DEVE Fazer</button>
        <button class="botao-secao" data-modal-target="modalViaSacra">Via-Sacra Completa (14 Estações)</button>
